A||||7||RiceCooker||I have a lot to say........||||6||
Z||000000||RiceCooker||03-19-2001||05:58 PM||||let's see...where to start.....hmmmmmm.....<P>THE RICECOOKER IS BACK!!!!!<P><BR>Yup, it's been so nice here that i couldnt wait any longer. Put in a new battery changed the oil, etc, etc, cleaned her up real nice. <P>Last year she was pretty sick, among other things it seemed my cooling system was giving me guf all year. Well after driving for two days, not a drop of coolant has leaked out. And no more Service Engine soon light! I have no explanation, I think she was just tired near the end of last year.<P>If she keeps up this great behavior I'm going to have no choice but to treat her to some nice new lowering springs and a fresh N tasty paint job  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Everything is even BETTER than i remember it! The car is just soooo loud! Until I drown it out with Pearl Jam blasting from 8 speakers!! Throw it on 12 disc random and just drive.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I love getting attention from complete strangers too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> People ask me about it  and i feel more than obligated to tell them every single thing about fieros. (Most people get scared away)<P>I need to get some updated pics for everyone. I'm about a month away from my road trip. Me and my friend are headin out to BC. I can't wait. <P>I think i'm rambling now but thanks for listening. I feel i can't contain my excitement! I hate getting to work or getting home cause it means i have to get out of my car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>One last thing, I got my custom license plate ordered. It's gonna be: "GVN2FLY"<BR>It's the name of a Pearl Jam song (Given to Fly) Dedicated to my late friend Clayton McGloan (1981-1998)<BR>And it sounds like a good name for a plate. After all the car was given to me to FLY, baby! I think "RICECKR" would attract vandalism, and i don't feel like getting shot today.<P>Happy Cruising everyone<BR>Todd  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004312.html" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004312.html</A> <BR>  ||||reg||6
Z||000001||ArchMagi||03-19-2001||11:57 PM||||Awesome! and glad to hear it!<BR>Where are you stopping in BC?||||reg||1
